# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #method-parts; plan SF15): b: merge: S copies S, the code a split call runs, with its place
# holders -- the [own, PLACE, r] of x, y and w: they are operations of the code, copied with it, never holders of a
# place outside it. b keeps S's y 3 and w 5; S over D still reads D's x 41 and writes D's y 42 and w 5 after the copy.
# Entry 7.
S:
    int: x
    int: y 3
    y: x + 1
    int: w 5
end: S
D:
    int: w 0
    int: y 0
    int: x 41
end: D
b: merge: S
call: S D
int: r 81
if: b\y = 3 && b\w = 5 && D\y = 42 && D\x = 41 && D\w = 5
    r: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
